{% comment %}
  Step 5 of 5 — final review before booking. Shows a read-only summary of
  everything collected in the previous steps (doctor, day/time, patient
  name, mode) and a "Confirm Booking" button.

  Doctor summary card reuses the same data-kal-doctor-summary/
  data-kal-summary-name/-meta/-mode hooks as the Slot Picker step — still
  static placeholder text for the same reason (doctor-selection data
  fetching is deferred), but the mode badge stays in sync automatically
  since setMode() in kal-booking-flow.js already updates every
  [data-kal-summary-mode] element on the page, not just Slot Picker's.

  The four detail rows (Patient Name, Mode, Day & Time, Fee) are populated
  by renderConfirmationSummary() in kal-booking-flow.js, reading straight
  from the patientDetails/slotPicker state already being tracked — no new
  state, just displaying what was already collected. Fee is still a static
  ₹800 placeholder (no real fee-lookup wired yet, same category as the
  doctor's name/photo being placeholders).

  "Confirm Booking" is NOT wired to the backend (explicit instruction
  throughout this build — "dont integrate it"). data-kal-confirm-booking is
  a hook with no click handler yet; when backend integration happens, this
  is where the two-call sequence documented in
  kal-booking-flow-step-patient-details.liquid (create hold, then POST
  /api/public/appointments) should fire. It also carries
  data-kal-goto="booking-confirmed" so the button navigates to the
  post-booking success screen for demo purposes in the meantime — once a
  real click handler is added for the API calls, that handler should only
  call goToStep('booking-confirmed') after a successful booking, not
  unconditionally like the plain data-kal-goto does today.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="kal-step-confirmation">

  {%- comment -%} ============ MOBILE ONLY (below 750px) ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="kal-step-confirmation__mobile">

    <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__header">
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__back" data-kal-back="patient-details" aria-label="Back">
        {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'chevron-left' -%}
      </button>
      <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress">
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot--active"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-text">5/5</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__intro">
      <p class="kal-step-doctor-select__eyebrow">Step 5 of 5</p>
      <h2 class="kal-step-doctor-select__heading">Confirm your slot</h2>
      <p class="kal-step-doctor-select__subtext">Check the details before we hold it for you.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-doctor-summary" data-kal-doctor-summary>
      <span class="kal-doctor-summary__avatar"></span>
      <span class="kal-doctor-summary__info">
        <span class="kal-doctor-summary__name" data-kal-summary-name>Dr. Neethu</span>
        <span class="kal-doctor-summary__meta" data-kal-summary-meta>General Physician - 12yrs</span>
      </span>
      <span class="kal-doctor-summary__mode" data-kal-summary-mode>Online</span>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-confirmation-details">
      <p class="kal-confirmation-details__label">Consultation Details</p>
      <div class="kal-confirmation-details__divider"></div>
      <div class="kal-confirmation-details__rows">
        <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Patient Name</span>
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-name>—</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Mode</span>
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-mode>—</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Day &amp; Time</span>
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-datetime>—</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Fee</span>
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value">&#8377;800</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-confirmation-pay-notice">
      <span class="kal-confirmation-pay-notice__icon">
        {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'credit-card' -%}
      </span>
      <span class="kal-confirmation-pay-notice__text">Pay at the clinic &mdash; cash or card at reception</span>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-slot-picker__footer">
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__continue" data-kal-confirm-booking data-kal-goto="booking-confirmed">
        Confirm Booking
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    ============ DESKTOP (750px and up) ============
    Reuses .kal-step-doctor-select__desktop/__panel directly, same as Slot
    Picker and Patient Details — one shared CSS rule for the grid/panel
    shape, no separate kal-step-confirmation__desktop/__panel copy to drift
    out of sync.

    No "pay at the clinic" notice here — unlike mobile, this Figma export
    doesn't include it at all (goes straight from the details card to the
    button, confirmed in both the screenshot and the Copy-as-CSS export).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__desktop">
    <div class="kal-step-entry__info">
      <div class="kal-step-entry__info-content">
        <h2 class="kal-step-entry__heading">Confirm your slot</h2>
        <p class="kal-step-entry__body-text">Check the details before we hold it for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="kal-step-entry__location">
        <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--location">
          <!-- ICON: location-pin (not received yet) -->
        </span>
        <span class="kal-step-entry__location-text">
          Kerala Ayurveda Wellness Center, Kormangala &middot; Opens 8 AM
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__panel">
      <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress kal-step-doctor-select__progress--desktop">
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot--active"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-text">5/5</span>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-step-confirmation__scroll">
        <div class="kal-doctor-summary" data-kal-doctor-summary>
          <span class="kal-doctor-summary__avatar"></span>
          <span class="kal-doctor-summary__info">
            <span class="kal-doctor-summary__name" data-kal-summary-name>Dr. Neethu</span>
            <span class="kal-doctor-summary__meta" data-kal-summary-meta>General Physician - 12yrs</span>
          </span>
          <span class="kal-doctor-summary__mode" data-kal-summary-mode>Online</span>
        </div>

        <div class="kal-confirmation-details">
          <p class="kal-confirmation-details__label">Consultation Details</p>
          <div class="kal-confirmation-details__divider"></div>
          <div class="kal-confirmation-details__rows">
            <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Patient Name</span>
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-name>—</span>
            </div>
            <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Mode</span>
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-mode>—</span>
            </div>
            <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Day &amp; Time</span>
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-datetime>—</span>
            </div>
            <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Fee</span>
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value">&#8377;800</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__desktop-footer">
        <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__continue" data-kal-confirm-booking>
          Confirm Booking
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
